 ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │ What Flatte is                                                                         │
 │                                                                                        │
 │ Flatte is a Go-native TUI foundation. You keep one mutable state struct, mutate it     │
 │ directly in Handle, and render one pure frame in View — no Msg/Cmd/Update loop, no     │
 │ message plumbing.                                                                      │
 │                                                                                        │
 │ state   is your struct — the single source of truth                                    │
 │ view    is a pure function: state in, frame out                                        │
 │ async   is one named, self-applying update                                             │
 │                                                                                        │
 │ Everything on these tabs — the snake game, the docker TUI, this text — is one          │
 │ Flatte app hosting others. Apps compose because they are just State + Handle +         │
 │ View.                                                                                  │
 │                                                                                        │
 │ → Ctrl+←/→ or click a tab to explore                                                   │
